          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can use place value strategies to divide some large numbers quickly and efficiently.</p>",
            "readable_text": "We can use place value strategies to divide some large numbers quickly and efficiently.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To demonstrate, let&#x27;s discuss how to use place value strategies to solve the following division problem:</p>",
            "readable_text": "To demonstrate, let's discuss how to use place value strategies to solve the following division problem:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: {\\color{red}{20}} \\div 2]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: {\\color{red}{20}} \\div 2]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we write the number we&#x27;re dividing <span class=\"math\">[MATH: ({\\color{red}{20}})]</span> in expanded form:</p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we write the number we're dividing [MATH: ({\\color{red}{20}})] in expanded form:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \u00d7 10 \u00f7 2]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 2 \u00d7 10 \u00f7 2]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Then, we swap the order of the multiplication and division and evaluate the expression:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Then, we swap the order of the multiplication and division and evaluate the expression:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \u00d7 10 \u00f7 2|=; 2 \u00f7 2 \u00d7 10|=; (2 \u00f7 2) \u00d7 10|=; 1 \u00d7 10|=; 10]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 2 \u00d7 10 \u00f7 2|=; 2 \u00f7 2 \u00d7 10|=; (2 \u00f7 2) \u00d7 10|=; 1 \u00d7 10|=; 10]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Therefore, </p>",
            "readable_text": "Therefore,",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 20 \\div 2 = 10.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 20 \\div 2 = 10.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nWe can use place value strategies to divide some large numbers quickly and efficiently.\n\nContent:\nTo demonstrate, let's discuss how to use place value strategies to solve the following division problem:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: {\\color{red}{20}} \\div 2]\n\nContent:\nFirst, we write the number we're dividing [MATH: ({\\color{red}{20}})] in expanded form:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 2 \u00d7 10 \u00f7 2]\n\nContent:\nThen, we swap the order of the multiplication and division and evaluate the expression:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 2 \u00d7 10 \u00f7 2|=; 2 \u00f7 2 \u00d7 10|=; (2 \u00f7 2) \u00d7 10|=; 1 \u00d7 10|=; 10]\n\nContent:\nTherefore,\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 20 \\div 2 = 10.]"
      },
